  "notes": [
    "Two defect parts: the router's DSAuth self-trust (since deployment) and the colony implementation's self-calling executeMetaTransaction, reached via the router's resolver; tx 0xd54ad876 (colony upgrade) set that resolver (slot 2) to 0x7490022b, which routes to 0x4e7f1e1e, so it sets the age.",
    "Campaign: every MetaTransactionExecuted carrying setResolver on Arbitrum and Gnosis (none before the anchor; 239 and 518 colonies after), plus each drained colony's outflows to non-attackers checked via explorer; 24 txs depleted colonies. No such calls on Ethereum.",
    "CLNY, TRUST, SOFIA and token 0x841c1d were drained but never sold (CLNY only bridged), so they carry $0 (rule 12); PPT is valued at the 34.58 WXDAI its drainer realised. FOX is at DefiLlama price."
  ],
